From 6adf6e68099639c66072d8a5bce6dc207afbf11c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 09:39:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Clean up dead code and repo clutter

- Remove 17 orphaned .patch files left over from applying past fixes
  (never referenced after their corresponding commits landed)
- Remove the unfinished "TextImage" CMS block: it was never registered
  in Payload's block library, so it couldn't be used from the admin;
  its component was duplicated in two locations, rendered via an
  `any`-cast in render-blocks.tsx's default case, and used a raw
  <img> instead of next/image
- Normalize CRLF line endings to LF in two files (contact-form.ts/tsx),
  matching .editorconfig
- Apply Prettier formatting to bring queries.ts, work-filters.tsx and
  merge-narrative-paragraphs.ts back in line with the project style

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NmbMBWtqtKDP2qBMGvpf2h
